        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana HPS88, Solid Brass Hinge Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis universal fit door stop is mounted on a door hinge pin instead of on the floor or baseboard. Easily adjustable, simple to use, out of the way, out of sight and available in great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUniversal fit - for use with most common sized door hinges (3.5\" x 3.5\", 4\" x 4\" and 4.5\" x 4.5\" door hinges). They work with all hinges that have a hinge pin of 5/16\" diameter or less. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe door opening adjustment range is approximately from 90 degrees to 140 degrees. Note that the thickness of the jamb moulding and the distance of the hinge pin from the door face will affect the adjustment range for each application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"295\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-HPS88-specifications.gif?v=1704354521\" width=\"295\" height=\"243\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hinge Mount Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana HPS88 Hinge Pin Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin Diameter with Reducer Bushing: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Opening Range: 90 - 140 Degrees, Approximate</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumpers: 9/16\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/HPS88.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana HPS88 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
